qual weight split the visitor's attention."}]]}],"$L36","$L37","$L38","$L39"]}]]}]
2f:["$","section",null,{"className":"mt-6 rounded-md border border-border bg-bg-panel p-8","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"mb-4 text-2xl font-bold text-fg","children":"When raising budget is the right move"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-relaxed text-fg-muted","children":"Budget is the right lever when all of the following are true:"}],["$","ul",null,{"className":"mt-5 space-y-3","children":[["$","li","0",{"className":"flex items-start gap-3 text-fg-muted","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"shrink-0 mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-accent"}],"Your paid search conversion rate is at or above the average for your vertical (WordStream 2026: Business Services 4.85%, all-industries 8.18%)"]}],["$","li","1",{"className":"flex items-start gap-3 text-fg-muted","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"shrink-0 mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-accent"}],"You have at least 500 paid sessions through the same page to confirm the rate is stable - not a statistical artefact of a good week"]}],["$","li","2",{"className":"flex items-start gap-3 text-fg-muted","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"shrink-0 mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-accent"}],"You have verified the 9 signals are structurally in place on the page"]}],["$","li","3",{"className":"flex items-start gap-3 text-fg-muted","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"shrink-0 mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-accent"}],"You have confirmed the rate holds on mobile (not just desktop)"]}],["$","li","4",{"className":"flex items-start gap-3 text-fg-muted","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"shrink-0 mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-accent"}],"Increasing volume does not require changing targeting to lower-intent audiences to find more traffic"]}]]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-5 leading-relaxed text-fg-muted","children":"If any of these are not true, the budget increase will produce a predictable result: more traffic at the same leaking rate, more cost per non-conversion, and no new diagnostic signal about what is broken."}]]}]
30:["$","section",null,{"className":"mt-6 rounded-md border border-border bg-bg-panel p-8","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"mb-4 text-2xl font-bold text-fg","children":"Fixing the page reduces CPC - you get more from current budget"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-relaxed text-fg-muted","children":"Landing Page Experience is one of the three components of Google Ads Quality Score. A page that loads fast, matches the keyword, and provides a clear path to conversion earns a higher Landing Page Experience rating - which directly improves Quality Score."}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-4 leading-relaxed text-fg-muted","children":"Quality Score affects your cost-per-click in the ad auction. A higher Quality Score means you pay less for the same position. In competitive verticals, the difference between a Quality Score of 4 and 8 can mean paying significantly less per click for the same ad placement. This means fixing the page does two things: raises the conversion rate on the traffic you receive, and lowers the cost of each click."}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-4 leading-relaxed text-fg-muted","children":"Raising budget while Quality Score is low does the opposite: you are paying a premium per click to drive traffic to a page that converts poorly. The two problems compound each other. Fix the page first - the budget you have already becomes more effective."}]]}]
31:["$","section",null,{"className":"mt-6 rounded-md border border-border bg-bg-panel p-8","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"mb-6 text-2xl font-bold text-fg","children":"Frequently asked questions"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"space-y-6","children":[["$","div","0",{"className":"border-b border-border pb-6 last:border-0 last:pb-0","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"mb-2 font-semibold text-fg","children":"When should I raise my ad budget?"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-relaxed text-fg-muted","children":"When your page is already converting paid traffic at or above the average rate for your vertical and traffic source - and you want more volume of the same result. If your conversion rate is below vertical average on meaningful traffic (500+ paid sessions), raising budget increases waste at the same rate your page is currently leaking it. Fix the page first, then scale."}]]}],["$","div","1",{"className":"border-b border-border pb-6 last:border-0 last:pb-0","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"mb-2 font-semibold text-fg","children":"How do I know if my problem is the page or the targeting?"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-relaxed text-fg-muted","children":"Segment your analytics by source, device, and time-on-page. If your paid search traffic (high intent) bounces at 80%+ but your email traffic (warm) converts at 10%, the page is structurally broken - not the targeting. If all traffic sources bounce equally, and your click-through rate on the ads is healthy, the page is the problem. If CTR on ads is below 2% for search, the targeting or ad copy is the problem and the page is secondary."}]]}],["$","div","2",{"className":"border-b border-border pb-6 last:border-0 last:pb-0","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"mb-2 font-semibold text-fg","children":"What is the minimum conversion rate before raising ad budget?"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-relaxed text-fg-muted","children":"There is no universal minimum, but a useful working threshold: if your paid search conversion rate is below 3% on 500+ sessions, you have a page problem worth fixing before increasing spend. WordStream's 2026 benchmark for Business Services (B2B lead gen) is 4.85%. If you are below that with meaningful volume, more budget produces more bounces at the same rate - not more customers."}]]}],["$","div","3",{"className":"border-b border-border pb-6 last:border-0 last:pb-0","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"mb-2 font-semibold text-fg","children":"Does fixing the landing page improve Google Ads Quality Score?"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-relaxed text-fg-muted","children":"Yes. Landing Page Experience is one of the three components of Quality Score (alongside Expected CTR and Ad Relevance). Improving message-match between the ad keyword and the page headline, adding above-fold proof, and reducing LCP below 2.5 seconds all directly improve Landing Page Experience. A higher Quality Score lowers your CPC in the Google Ads auction - meaning the same budget buys more clicks after the page fix."}]]}],["$","div","4",{"className":"border-b border-border pb-6 last:border-0 last:pb-0","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"mb-2 font-semibold text-fg","children":"What is a practical way to check for landing page leaks before raising budget?"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-relaxed text-fg-muted","children":"Run the 9-signal check in order: (1) does the headline match the ad promise? (2) is proof visible before the CTA? (3) does the page load and display correctly on mobile at 390px? (4) is LCP under 2.5 seconds? (5) is there one clear CTA - not three options? (6) does the form ask for the minimum required information? (7) is there specific social proof - a result, a number, a named customer? The first signal that fails is the first fix. Earlier signals gate later ones."}]]}]]}]]}]
32:["$","section",null,{"className":"mt-6 rounded-2xl border border-accent/40 bg-bg-panel p-8","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"mb-4 text-2xl font-bold text-fg","children":"Run the leak check before the next budget increase"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mb-6 leading-relaxed text-fg-muted","children":"The free Nebula audit checks all 9 signals and returns a prioritised fix list. The $97 One-Leak Repair Sprint supplies a tailored change for one high-confidence page-level finding. You or your developer implements it, and the 30-day re-audit verifies the page condition - before you spend another dollar on traffic."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"flex flex-wrap gap-4","children":[["$","$L21",null,{"href":"/audit?utm_source=learning-centre&utm_medium=organic-content","className":"inline-flex rounded bg-accent px-6 py-3 font-semibold text-bg hover:opacity-85 hover:bg-accent transition-colors","children":"Run the free audit"}],["$","$L21",null,{"href":"/pricing","className":"inline-flex rounded border border-accent px-6 py-3 font-semibold text-accent hover:bg-accent-dim transition-colors","children":"See the One-Leak Repair Sprint"}]]}]]}]
33:["$","section",null,{"className":"mt-6 rounded-md border border-border bg-bg-panel p-8","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"mb-4 text-2xl font-bold text-fg","children":"Related leak checks"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"space-y-1","children":[["$","$L21","/learning-centre/google-ads-clicks-no-sales",{"href":"/learning-centre/google-ads-clicks-no-sales","className":"block border-b border-border py-2.5 text-fg-muted transition-colors last:border-0 hover:text-accent","children":"Google Ads Clicks But No Sales: Check The Page"}],["$","$L21","/learning-centre/high-cpc-low-conversion",{"href":"/learning-centre/high-cpc-low-conversion","className":"block border-b border-border py-2.5 text-fg-muted transition-colors last:border-0 hover:text-accent","children":"High CPC, Low Conversion: Which Layer Is Broken"}],["$","$L21","/learning-centre/landing-page-not-converting",{"href":"/learning-centre/landing-page-not-converting","className":"block border-b border-border py-2.5 text-fg-muted transition-colors last:border-0 hover:text-accent","children":"Landing Page Not Converting? Diagnose These 5 Leaks First"}],["$","$L21","/learning-centre/landing-page-conversion-rate-benchmark",{"href":"/learning-centre/landing-page-conversion-rate-benchmark","className":"block border-b border-border py-2.5 text-fg-muted transition-colors last:border-0 hover:text-accent","children":"Landing Page Conversion Rate Benchmark: What The Numbers Mean"}],["$","$L21","/learning-centre/facebook-ads-no-leads",{"href":"/learning-centre/facebook-ads-no-leads","className":"block border-b border-border py-2.5 text-fg-muted transition-colors last:border-0 hover:text-accent","children":"Facebook Ads Getting Clicks But No Leads"}]]}]]}]
36:["$","li","Above-fold clarity",{"className":"rounded-xl border border-border bg-bg-muted/10 p-5","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"flex items-center gap-3 mb-2","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"shrink-0 text-xs font-bold text-accent bg-accent/10 rounded-full w-6 h-6 flex items-center justify-center","children":6}],["$","p",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-fg","children":["Signal ",6,": ","Above-fold clarity"]}]]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm leading-relaxed text-fg-muted pl-9","children":"Can a first-time visitor identify the offer, who it is for, and what to do next within 5 seconds of landing - without scrolling? If the value proposition is below the fold, most paid visitors never see it."}]]}]
37:["$","li","Ad signals",{"className":"rounded-xl border border-border bg-bg-muted/10 p-5","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"flex items-center gap-3 mb-2","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"shrink-0 text-xs font-bold text-accent bg-accent/10 rounded-full w-6 h-6 flex items-center justify-center","children":7}],["$","p",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-fg","children":["Signal ",7,": ","Ad signals"]}]]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm leading-relaxed text-fg-muted pl-9","children":"Do the page's conversion elements (form, CTA, offer framing) align with the campaign objective and audience segment the ad targets? Misalignment between ad promise and page delivery wastes spend."}]]}]
38:["$","li","SEO foundations",{"className":"rounded-xl border border-border bg-bg-muted/10 p-5","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"flex items-center gap-3 mb-2","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"shrink-0 text-xs font-bold text-accent bg-accent/10 rounded-full w-6 h-6 flex items-center justify-center","children":8}],["$","p",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-fg","children":["Signal ",8,": ","SEO foundations"]}]]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm leading-relaxed text-fg-muted pl-9","children":"Does the page have a unique title tag, meta description, and crawlable body content that reinforces the keyword intent the paid campaign also targets? Organic and paid pages that contradict each other dilute authority."}]]}]
